{"kind":"inner","text":"That forty-millisecond headline makes me brace for another number I'll have to explain away later. But I haven't seen his timer, and I'm already annoyed with him. That's unfair. I want to know whether he'll show me the awkward bits without spending our whole slot trying to sound impressive.","actual_native_return":"That forty-millisecond headline makes me brace for another number I'll have to explain away later. But I haven't seen his timer, and I'm already annoyed with him. That's unfair. I want to know whether he'll show me the awkward bits without spending our whole slot trying to sound impressive."}